<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 181-7 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 181-7 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal, in reply to Boland's first innings of 133, were 181 for seven in their first innings at lunch on the second day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Boland 133. Natal 181-7 in 56 overs (Dale Benkenstein 50; Henry Williams 4-46).</p>
